PRESUMPTIVE CONDITION: Cancers of: lung , bronchus , larynx , and trachea ; if exposed to Agent Orange . Breathing related cancers; if exposed to Burn pits . If diagnosed with brochiolo-alveolar carcinoma , lung , or pharynx cancers and exposed to Ionizing radiation . If diagnosed with cancers of: larynx , lung (except mesothelioma), and nasopharyngeal cancers and exposed to Mustard gas ;
